---
description: Server route and database conventions
globs: server/src/routes/**,server/src/db/**
alwaysApply: false
---

New HTTP handlers live in `server/src/routes/*.route.ts` and register through `registerRoutes` in `server/src/routes/index.ts`.

Shared request and response types belong in `@excalidraw/api-types`.

Server tests use a per-file `// @vitest-environment node` docblock.

See `.cursor/skills/server-conventions/SKILL.md` for the endpoint checklist.
